# Normalise to LF in the working tree as well as the repository.
#
# Mixed CRLF/LF endings silently defeated several scripted edits during
# development: a patch written with LF simply failed to match and reported
# success. Pinning this removes that whole class of confusion, and stops the
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warning on every commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
